title: "homedeck"
abstract: "Open-source, console-style local media center that connects PC, Android, Android TV and Samsung (Tizen) TVs peer-to-peer over the home network, with no server and no cloud."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "homedeck contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/lucacasanova/homedeck"
url: "https://lucacasanova.github.io/homedeck/"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
keywords:
  - media center
  - local-first
  - peer-to-peer
  - smart TV
  - Tizen
  - Android TV
  - Tauri
  - Rust
